        <p class="email-consent">By submitting your email you agree to receive personalised fragrance recommendations and marketing emails from us. View our <a href="/policies/privacy-policy" target="_blank">Privacy Policy</a> and <a href="/policies/terms-of-service" target="_blank">Terms &amp; Conditions</a>.</p>
